// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3817469985" "I'm not moving!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3563826164" "This isn't over."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4268993842" "I can bide my time..."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1124708789" "When this is over...watch your back."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P252030774" "You're really making a mistake here."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2429336929" "I can't believe you're doing this."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4040304087" "You're a dirty cop.  You will pay."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2134148929" "I got friends in high places, cop.  This won't go unnoticed."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3191371765" "When this is over, getting fired from the force is going to be the LEAST of your worries."

// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P279367504" "Saved by an interruption!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1141766457" "Time for some anger management exercises!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1043953018" "Sleep with one eye open."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1561890655" "I will see you very soon, copper!  But first, I'll deal with this."

// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_THREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1194216113" "This is not Paragon City, punk.  You have NO rights here."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_THREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2272519885" "Don't move and maybe I'll let you keep your head."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_THREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1248136878" "Rule number one:  you have no rights."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_THREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3282343533" "Don't move."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_THREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P21425612" "One word and you become a distant memory."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_THREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P157773403" "You have the right to remain silent.  Anything you say or do WILL be held against you."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_THREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P963608677" "There is a gun pointed at you.  Don't get stupid."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_THREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3893420763" "I am Rogue Isles Police.  Put it together.  Mess with me and you're DEAD."

// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_THREATEN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2323831162" "You got a problem, pal?"
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_THREATEN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3065937417" "I'll haul you in next!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_THREATEN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P192900991" "See this badge?  It says I can do whatever...I...want!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_THREATEN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4124933728" "This is law enforcement!  You can't go antagonizing the law!"

// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3585271348" "Yeah, Dispatch, we got more.  They never learn."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1547389541" "Sure.  I'll bring 'em over in a minute."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1937528254" "Can I 'interrogate' before I drop 'em off?"
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P641097022" "Right.  I'm on it."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4290192572" "Oh, I don't think this one's going anywhere."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2071431821" "Tell Lord Recluse that this cop is pulling his weight."

// MERCY_DARWIN_BATTLEDOME_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2859825238" "Just let them fight.  Best to let them exterminate each other rather than make us do it."
// MERCY_DARWIN_BATTLEDOME_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3813489929" "Those guys are spooky.  I'd hate to get touched by one of them."
// MERCY_DARWIN_BATTLEDOME_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P721883332" "Huh...some crowd tonight."
// MERCY_DARWIN_BATTLEDOME_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P14883929" "We break this up at dawn."

// MERCY_DARWIN_BATTLEDOME_GUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1832379258" "Oh, you wanna join the battle?  Great, let's go!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_BATTLEDOME_GUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P933151306" "New contestant!  Right here!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_BATTLEDOME_GUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1086396930" "Free admission to all meat fresh out of the Zig!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_BATTLEDOME_GUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2357621966" "Another contestant!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_BATTLEDOME_GUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3605647529" "Today's lesson:  pain.  Lots of it."
// MERCY_DARWIN_BATTLEDOME_GUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1994948892" "I swear, you must be as dumb as a box of hair, punk."

// MERCY_DARWIN_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2667506824" "Welcome to Mercy Island.  Tell me everything I want to know."
// MERCY_DARWIN_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3924661017" "You must be new here.  Don't move or I'll blow your head off."
// MERCY_DARWIN_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P359439124" "There are ways of making people talk.  And then there are WAYS.  I prefer ones that involve plenty of blood."
// MERCY_DARWIN_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2976900853" "I have plenty of time to play.  Let's get that straight."
// MERCY_DARWIN_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2751913928" "See this badge?  I am law enforcement.  I can force you to do any old thing I want."
// MERCY_DARWIN_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2271833257" "You have the right to remain silent.  You have the right to have your face kicked in by me."

// MERCY_DARWIN_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1281479856" "More meat has arrived at the Landing!  Let's do some police work!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P908827753" "You need to learn some respect for the men in blue!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2050662949" "Can you believe I just got attacked by some street punk?"
// MERCY_DARWIN_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2245592450" "Consider this a ticket!"

// MERCY_MERCY_CAUGHT_VICTIM_THANKS_TEXT :
"P1117670517" "Thanks, pal!"
// MERCY_MERCY_CAUGHT_VICTIM_THANKS_TEXT :
"P809340896" "Finally, I caught a break!"
// MERCY_MERCY_CAUGHT_VICTIM_THANKS_TEXT :
"P2655329609" "I'm makin' a break for it!"
// MERCY_MERCY_CAUGHT_VICTIM_THANKS_TEXT :
"P2485545916" "Let's get out of here!"
// MERCY_MERCY_CAUGHT_VICTIM_THANKS_TEXT :
"P2793393019" "Hit him again!"
// MERCY_MERCY_CAUGHT_VICTIM_THANKS_TEXT :
"P311006135" "Looks like it's my lucky day!"

// MERCY_DARWIN_CAUGHT_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1503545031" "I don't know what to tell you.  Just tell me what you want!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_CAUGHT_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3464735072" "I don't know what you're looking for."
// MERCY_DARWIN_CAUGHT_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1547468239" "Just...just let me go."
// MERCY_DARWIN_CAUGHT_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2725163139" "I'm sure we can work this out."
// MERCY_DARWIN_CAUGHT_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3992508673" "No need for weapons, let's work this out."
// MERCY_DARWIN_CAUGHT_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2482714724" "You're a cop!  You're supposed to SERVE and PROTECT!"

// MERCY_ALLHOODS_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4099956720" "Looks like we got ourselves a 'situation' here."
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4262112400" "I'll take care of this."
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3658648886" "You got a problem?"

// MERCY_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3397478937" "We got it covered.  Over."
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P590039738" "Sure, we got fights here and there.  If they get important, we'll jump in."
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P174252008" "How's it look where you are?"
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1854898547" "Sarge, I'll be keeping an eye on this particular beat.  Don't you worry about me, sir."
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4070371023" "One second, I need to do something here.  You!  Keep moving!"
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P513940786" "One sec.  I'm watching you!   Okay, I'm back."
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P293358314" "Yeah, I'll meet you back at the precinct later.  We got some Recluse business to discuss."
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4152798342" "I want to make sure Arachnos has our backs on this.  We get nailed, I lose my pension."

// MERCY_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P745147787" "Gotta go!  I think I see some perps!"
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3036711198" "Can't talk.  Got a disturbance to take care of!"
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3938577342" "This beat just got a lot more interesting."
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4047222997" "Gotta go, Sarge, looks like I have some serving and protecting to do!"
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3618190635" "I don't like you."

// MERCY_DARWIN_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2405284760" "Did you see the dregs the plane dropped off earlier?"
// MERCY_DARWIN_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P319414566" "Every day a new batch of Zig rejects.  I put half those guys in there."
// MERCY_DARWIN_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1446555490" "We have our work cut out for us on this new batch of Zig prisoners."
// MERCY_DARWIN_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2487504762" "Did you see the prisoners coming off the Zig copters?  Eesh."
// MERCY_DARWIN_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P450832059" "We do what we always do.  Which is whatever Recluse tells us.  I keep my nose clean.  Don't need grief from that guy."
// MERCY_DARWIN_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2208065878" "Don't say anything to anyone, but ever since I started working for Arachnos, man I have been raking in the dough!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2225247618" "Sure, just flash the badge.  They got no idea who we really work for."

// MERCY_DARWIN_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2499419950" "Was I talking to you?"
// MERCY_DARWIN_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1213815886" "You must think you're someone pretty special to be walking in on a private chat."
// MERCY_DARWIN_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P101840937" "What are you doing?"
// MERCY_DARWIN_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P205275235" "Only shark bait eavesdrops on a private discussion."
// MERCY_DARWIN_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2105641205" "We can't take the chance you didn't hear anything.  You're gonna have to go!"

// MERCY_DARWIN_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2817733593" "Just look at them all.  Dregs from the Zig."
// MERCY_DARWIN_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P242110327" "I hate this beat."
// MERCY_DARWIN_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1037291508" "If someone messes with you, deal with them using any...means...necessary."
// MERCY_DARWIN_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2537288469" "See the Landing?  Look what the cat dragged in."
// MERCY_DARWIN_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2928980815" "Make sure they see the badge.  They need to know cops are watching them."
// MERCY_DARWIN_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P668588012" "I'm watching you.  And you."

// MERCY_DARWIN_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3802160599" "Time for some law enforcement!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2805654659" "We make an example!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1287795222" "You got some nerve attacking a respected police officer!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2112140395" "Now's the time to prove your worth to Recluse, meat!"

// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLEINFECTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1645800184" "You are an infection.  Prepare to be treated!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLEINFECTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2437400956" "Take them down before they infect others."
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLEINFECTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2051741090" "You're going to be eliminated."
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLEINFECTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1421355091" "You're going down."
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLEINFECTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3312458099" "I better get hazard pay for this!"

// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLEINFECTED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3083655779" "We got a situation here!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLEINFECTED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1742505671" "We got a straggler!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLEINFECTED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1381151473" "Get 'em, too!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLEINFECTED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3982321695" "Officer in trouble!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLEINFECTED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P693143301" "Hey, get them, too!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLEINFECTED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1457060086" "Excessive physical force is not only expected.  It's rewarded!"

// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLEHELLIONS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2909728027" "Hellions.  I hate Hellions."
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLEHELLIONS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1532446655" "This isn't Paragon City, pal.  You got no rights here!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLEHELLIONS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4027915556" "Oh I'm gonna enjoy this, Hellion!"

// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLEHELLIONS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2606242965" "We can do both!  Let's go!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLEHELLIONS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2512767978" "Get them, too!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLEHELLIONS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3885534874" "More meat for the fire!"

// MERCY_RUMBLESKULLS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P834194271" "You Skulls are as sorry as the Hellions.  Should have stayed in Perez, punk."
// MERCY_RUMBLESKULLS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1960797136" "Let me drum a tune on your bones."
// MERCY_RUMBLESKULLS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2011606752" "You Skulls are a blight in Paragon and you're a blight here!"
// MERCY_RUMBLESKULLS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1928759915" "You have the right to be taken down a few pegs by me."

// MERCY_RUMBLESKULLS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3861435140" "Skulls and meat.  Why not?"
// MERCY_RUMBLESKULLS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3959009608" "They...just...don't...learn."
// MERCY_RUMBLESKULLS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P237555391" "You're mine for the picking!"
// MERCY_RUMBLESKULLS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1659721629" "Oh, you think so?  You need to respect the badge!"

// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLESNAKES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3697309468" "I hate Snakes."
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLESNAKES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3516676227" "I really hate Snakes."
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLESNAKES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3814002859" "Snakes.  I hate Snakes."
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLESNAKES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1496620178" "You should have stayed in your hole, Snakes!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLESNAKES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1782044627" "Let this be a lesson to you!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLESNAKES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1743887046" "We need to thin your numbers, Snakes."
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLESNAKES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1515593264" "You're gonna learn about loss."

// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLESNAKES_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1975333972" "Teach them to stay out of police business!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLESNAKES_ALERT_TEXT :
"P355744653" "Better teach these guys not to mess with law enforcement!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLESNAKES_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4221349933" "Get them!"

// MERCY_DARWIN_SHOVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P197565472" "This is not Paragon City.  Will...you...never...learn?"
// MERCY_DARWIN_SHOVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2168370159" "What should we do with this guy?  Make an example of him?"
// MERCY_DARWIN_SHOVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3187023687" "Welcome to Mercy.  Enjoying your stay so far?"
// MERCY_DARWIN_SHOVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1807742824" "Okay.  Rule number one.  I am the law.  Learn it.  Live it."

// MERCY_DARWIN_SHOVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P370004839" "Looks like we got ourselves another peace disturber!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_SHOVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P975474109" "Let's welcome this one, too!  Get 'em!"

// MERCY_DARWIN_NPCSHOVED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
