// MERCY_DARWIN_NPCSHOVED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4222882544" "This wasn't on the brochure!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_NPCSHOVED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P970967075" "I don't know what you guys want!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_NPCSHOVED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P913315743" "Leave me alone!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_NPCSHOVED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P113601739" "This is assault!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_NPCSHOVED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1845174253" "You don't deserve to wear that uniform!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_NPCSHOVED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P736370454" "You're a dirty cop!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_NPCSHOVED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P514719893" "I'm going to report you, you dirty cop!"

// MERCY_DARWIN_WANDER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2097901765" "I think you're disturbing the peace.  That's too bad for you."
// MERCY_DARWIN_WANDER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2488542776" "Now you had to go and interrupt me while I was on my beat."
// MERCY_DARWIN_WANDER_ALERTED_TEXT :
