// MERCY_DARWIN_WANDER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1455346343" "You need to learn some respect for law enforcement."

// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLEFREEDOM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1236169299" "Yeah, whatever, Corps!  We're the REAL law here!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLEFREEDOM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
