// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLEFREEDOM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P405044897" "Get out of my way!"

// MERCY_DARWIN_ROADRUMBLE_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1452036502" "Yeah, we got some hopped up Infected tossing crates at us here.  Could use some backup."
// MERCY_DARWIN_ROADRUMBLE_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2339190870" "You better get over here.  They're tossing crates and acting freaky."
// MERCY_DARWIN_ROADRUMBLE_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3935384757" "Yeah, uh....little help here?  Freaked out Infected are hucking crates at us!"

// MERCY_DARWIN_ROADRUMBLE_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P295227320" "Great!  Just great!  Now we got you to deal with, too!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_ROADRUMBLE_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P530353392" "What is this?  Freakout day in Mercy?"
// MERCY_DARWIN_ROADRUMBLE_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
